{"type":"record","name":"RithmicDepthFrame","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.rithmic","doc":"Read-only Rithmic Test ES price-level book. Exact quarter-point ES ticks and SPX cents. Source receivedAtMs is never refreshed by Kafka replay or projection. Raw producer has mappingReady=false and null SPX prices; aligner writes mapped prices only with an admitted service basis. No order commands.","fields":[{"name":"schemaVersion","type":"int"},{"name":"environment","type":"string"},{"name":"exchange","type":"string"},{"name":"contract","type":"string"},{"name":"streamId","type":"string"},{"name":"sequence","type":"long"},{"name":"receivedAtMs","type":"long"},{"name":"emittedAtMs","type":"long"},{"name":"connected","type":"boolean"},{"name":"bookReady","type":"boolean"},{"name":"mappingReady","type":"boolean"},{"name":"basisCents","type":["null","long"],"default":null},{"name":"basisState","type":"string"},{"name":"basisEventTimeMs","type":["null","long"],"default":null},{"name":"basisMeasuredAtMs","type":["null","long"],"default":null},{"name":"reason","type":"string"},{"name":"bids","type":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"record","name":"DepthLevel","fields":[{"name":"esPriceTicks","type":"long"},{"name":"quantity","type":"long"},{"name":"spxPriceCents","type":["null","long"],"default":null}]}}},{"name":"asks","type":{"type":"array","items":"DepthLevel"}}]}